@ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@ApiKey = dev-local-api-key-change-in-prod

### Health check (sin autenticación)
GET {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Listar dispositivos registrados
GET {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualLabs
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar o actualizar dispositivo (Upsert + Heartbeat)
POST {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualLabs/register
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostname": "LAB-PC-01",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.0.50",
  "operatingSystem": "Microsoft Windows 11 Pro"
}

### Obtener dispositivo por ID
GET {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualLabs/1
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar dispositivo
PUT {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualLabs/1
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostname": "LAB-PC-01",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.0.51",
  "operatingSystem": "Microsoft Windows 11 Pro",
  "status": "Maintenance"
}

### Listar eventos de seguridad
GET {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualSecurity
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar evento de seguridad para el dispositivo 1
POST {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualSecurity
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "eventType": "FailedLogin",
  "severity": "High",
  "description": "5 intentos fallidos de inicio de sesión consecutivos."
}

### Eliminar dispositivo (y sus eventos en cascada)
DELETE {{ProjectAssetAPI_HostAddress}}/api/VisualLabs/1
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
